# ANCHORED. A bare `utils/` matches at ANY depth, and it silently amputated two
# subpackages of the vendored efficientvit -- models/utils and apps/utils -- so the
# perception node died on `from models import OWLv2, VitSam` while the tree looked
# complete. The partial success is what hid it: everything else imported fine.
/utils/
